  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for CulinaryCanvas', 'description': 'Primary container for CulinaryCanvas implementation: A tool that generates creative recipes based on user-provided ingredients using Cohere AI. It provides detailed, sensory-rich instructions and allows users to manage (generate/delete) recipes within their session.', 'interfaces': [], 'framework': 'angular', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "CulinaryCanvas-128 frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Ingredient Input",\n      "description": "Users can input a list of ingredients to be used for recipe generation.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "AI Recipe Generation",\n      "description": "The system sends the ingredient list to Cohere AI, which returns a detailed, creative recipe using only those ingredients. The recipe includes clear steps, cooking tips, and sensory details (smell, taste, texture).",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Recipe Deletion & State Reset",\n      "description": "When a user deletes a recipe, it is removed from storage/session and the state is reset so that new recipes are generated from scratch, with no memory of the deleted recipe.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "Angular"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#4CAF50",\n    "secondary": "#FFFFFF",\n    "accent": "#FF9800"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "A clean, modern interface with a prominent input area for ingredients, a \'Generate Recipe\' button, and a display section for the generated recipe. Each recipe has a \'Delete\' button. When no recipe is present, the input area is highlighted. Colors and layout should evoke a fresh, culinary feel."\n}'}",
